{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The apparent missing membership check in the vote tally is supplied by the outer path: received responses pass through `Peer.Handle`, which rejects unknown senders, and the candidate handler separately rejects observers. I’ll retain this as an explanation of that specific suspicion; it does not establish safety for votes already counted before a membership change.\n"}}
